                    This Privacy Policy details how Sahyak CRM handles personal data across our marketing website, customer communication channels, administrative portals, and cloud infrastructure. We are committed to transparency, data protection by design, and strict separation between website analytics, prospective customer records, and customer-controlled CRM data.
