                            <a href="#section-17" class="toc-link block py-1.5 pl-3 border-l-2 border-transparent text-gray-600 hover:text-brand-greenDark hover:border-brand-green transition-all">17. Data Retention Periods</a>
                            <a href="#section-18" class="toc-link block py-1.5 pl-3 border-l-2 border-transparent text-gray-600 hover:text-brand-greenDark hover:border-brand-green transition-all">18. Account Closure &amp; Deletion</a>
