                            <a href="#section-21" class="toc-link block py-1.5 pl-3 border-l-2 border-transparent text-gray-600 hover:text-brand-greenDark hover:border-brand-green transition-all">21. Data Subject Rights (DPDP)</a>
                            <a href="#section-22" class="toc-link block py-1.5 pl-3 border-l-2 border-transparent text-gray-600 hover:text-brand-greenDark hover:border-brand-green transition-all">22. Consent Withdrawal</a>
