                    <!-- SECTION 1 -->
                    <section id="section-1">
                        <h2>1. Introduction and Scope</h2>
                        <p>
                            Welcome to Sahyak CRM ("Sahyak", "we", "our", or "us"). We provide an enterprise, mobile-first Customer Relationship Management platform purpose-built for real estate brokers, property developers, sales agents, and channel partners across 15 priority global markets.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            This Privacy Policy sets out the principles and operational rules governing the collection, processing, storage, protection, and disclosure of information when you interact with our marketing website (<a href="https://sahyak.com" class="text-brand-greenDark underline font-medium">https://sahyak.com</a>), submit contact or sales inquiries, access downloadable resources, request product walkthroughs, or communicate with our team via email, telephone, or authorized messaging integrations.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            This policy does not govern third-party platforms that you may choose to link to or integrate with Sahyak CRM, which remain subject to their respective independent privacy notices.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <!-- SECTION 2 -->
                    <section id="section-2">
                        <h2>2. Identity of the Operating Entity</h2>
                        <p>
                            The Sahyak CRM website, intellectual property, brand assets, and platform services are developed and operated by <strong>Sahyak Real Estate Technologies Private Limited</strong>.
                        </p>
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-sm mb-4">
                            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1">Corporate &amp; Operational Address:</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-2">Bandra Kurla Complex (BKC), Bandra East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400051, India.</p>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-brand-dark mb-1">Electronic Inquiries:</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-0"><a href="mailto:support@sahyak.com" class="text-brand-greenDark underline">support@sahyak.com</a> | Telephone: <a href="tel:+918796475107" class="text-brand-greenDark underline">+91 87964 75107</a></p>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 italic">
                            * Note: Specific statutory corporate filing numbers (CIN and GSTIN) are maintained within verified internal business records and are formally provided on commercial contracts and service invoices.
                        </p>
                    </section>

                    <!-- SECTION 3 -->
                    <section id="section-3">
                        <h2>3. Categories of Individuals Covered</h2>
                        <p>This Privacy Policy distinguishes between four distinct categories of individuals whose information may be processed:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Website Visitors:</strong> Individuals who browse public web pages, review feature descriptions, compare multi-currency pricing plans, or read educational guides on <a href="https://sahyak.com" class="text-brand-greenDark underline">sahyak.com</a>.</li>
                            <li><strong>Prospective Customers &amp; Enquirers:</strong> Individuals who voluntarily complete our contact forms, request live platform demonstrations, ask pricing questions, or initiate communication via our verified WhatsApp hotline.</li>
                            <li><strong>Customer Account Users &amp; Administrators:</strong> Licensed brokers, developers, sales managers, and telecallers who are provisioned with authorized user accounts to access administrative and operational workspaces on the Sahyak CRM platform (<a href="https://crm.sahyak.com" class="text-brand-greenDark underline">crm.sahyak.com</a>).</li>
                            <li><strong>Third-Party Real Estate Leads &amp; Prospects:</strong> Home buyers, property investors, tenants, and site visit attendees whose names, phone numbers, or property preferences are entered into a customer's private workspace. (See Section 7 for the legal distinction regarding this category).</li>
                        </ul>
                    </section>

