                        <p>For authorized customer users and platform administrators accessing management interfaces:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Administrative Authentication:</strong> Credentials are verified against server-side authorization controls. Successful login generates a cryptographically signed HMAC-SHA256 session token stored in an essential, secure, <code>HttpOnly</code> cookie named <code>sahyak_admin_session</code> with a strict 24-hour expiration lifetime.</li>
                            <li><strong>Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):</strong> We record assigned organizational roles (such as Superadmin, Administrator, Team Lead, Telecaller, or Viewer) to enforce strict boundary checks and prevent unauthorized data modifications.</li>
                            <li><strong>Session Revocation:</strong> Active sessions are tracked in our Cloudflare D1 database (<code>admin_sessions</code> table). Logout actions immediately invalidate session records.</li>
                        </ul>
