                            <li><strong>Honeypot Anti-Bot Filter:</strong> Submissions contain a hidden anti-spam field (<code>website_url</code>). Automated spambots that populate this field are silently dropped without writing data to our database.</li>
                            <li><strong>IP Hash Rate Limiting:</strong> To safeguard our infrastructure against Denial of Service (DoS) and form flooding, client IP addresses are immediately transformed into an irreversible one-way SHA-256 cryptographic hash (<code>ip_hash</code>). Rate limits allow up to 5 inquiries per 10-minute window per IP hash. Raw IP addresses are discarded from volatile memory.</li>
                            <li><strong>D1 SQL Database Storage:</strong> Validated inquiries are stored in our secure Cloudflare D1 <code>contacts</code> table with status markers (e.g. <code>new</code>, <code>in-progress</code>, <code>resolved</code>).</li>
