                            <li><strong>Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) Defenses:</strong> State-mutating administrative APIs enforce strict <code>Origin</code> verification and <code>Sec-Fetch-Site</code> header inspection.</li>
                            <li><strong>Cloudflare Edge WAF &amp; DDoS Protection:</strong> Edge firewalls and rate limiters actively mitigate brute-force attempts and anomalous traffic floods.</li>
